{"method":"session.event","params":{"sessionId":"{{sessionId}}","event":{"type":"user/message","seq":10,"time":0,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\n以下信息描述你当前的会话：\n\n当前工作目录：\"{{cwd}}\"。\n\n当前 DSH 文件策略：workspace-write。由 DSH 文件沙箱强制执行的任何可用操作，都可以修改会话工作区（\"{{cwd}}\"）下的文件。部分平台临时区域也可能可写。\n\n本次会话已启用审批提示：需要审批的操作可能会通过已配置的应答方发起询问；如果没有可用的应答方，请求会被拒绝（fail closed）。\n\n你是 root agent。你的名字是 \"lead\"。\n\n要给其它 agent 发消息，请使用 send_message({ agent: \"<agent-name>\", message: \"...\" })。\n要找到你的协作 agent 及其名字，请使用 list_agents({})。\n</system-reminder>"}],"source":{"kind":"runtime-context","form":"snapshot","sections":[{"name":"working-directory:current","text":"当前工作目录：\"{{cwd}}\"。"},{"name":"sandbox:policy","text":"当前 DSH 文件策略：workspace-write。由 DSH 文件沙箱强制执行的任何可用操作，都可以修改会话工作区（\"{{cwd}}\"）下的文件。部分平台临时区域也可能可写。"},{"name":"approval:policy","text":"本次会话已启用审批提示：需要审批的操作可能会通过已配置的应答方发起询问；如果没有可用的应答方，请求会被拒绝（fail closed）。"},{"name":"subagent:identity","text":"你是 root agent。你的名字是 \"lead\"。\n\n要给其它 agent 发消息，请使用 send_message({ agent: \"<agent-name>\", message: \"...\" })。\n要找到你的协作 agent 及其名字，请使用 list_agents({})。"}]},"role":"user","id":"{{sessionId}}"},"surfaceOp":"append"}}}
{"method":"session.event","params":{"sessionId":"{{sessionId}}","event":{"type":"user/message","seq":11,"time":0,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\n技能是一组可复用的任务专用说明。本会话可用的技能如下：\n\n<available_skills>\n- `office`: Create or edit Office files; inspect Office files and PDFs. Load before rendering, conversion, or recalculation to enable office_render, office_convert, and office_recalculate next step.\n- `office-docx`: Create, read, edit, and validate Word documents (.docx).\n- `office-pptx`: Create, read, edit, and validate PowerPoint presentations (.pptx).\n- `office-xlsx`: Read, create, edit, and validate Excel workbooks, data, and formulas (.xlsx).\n</available_skills>\n\nIf the user names a skill, or the task clearly matches a skill's description, call the `skill` tool with the exact skill name before taking task actions. Load all applicable skills, then follow their full instructions. This catalog contains summaries only; do not infer or follow a skill's instructions until it has been loaded.\nA user may also invoke a skill directly; its <skill_content> block then appears in this conversation. Follow it, and do not call the `skill` tool again for that skill.\n</system-reminder>"}],"source":{"kind":"skill-catalog","form":"catalog","entries":[{"name":"office","description":"Create or edit Office files; inspect Office files and PDFs. Load before rendering, conversion, or recalculation to enable office_render, office_convert, and office_recalculate next step."},{"name":"office-docx","description":"Create, read, edit, and validate Word documents (.docx)."},{"name":"office-pptx","description":"Create, read, edit, and validate PowerPoint presentations (.pptx)."},{"name":"office-xlsx","description":"Read, create, edit, and validate Excel workbooks, data, and formulas (.xlsx)."}]},"role":"user","id":"{{sessionId}}"},"surfaceOp":"append"}}}
